// Every weapon, pointing at the one model this fixture has.
//
// WP_LoadWeaponParms fills the compiled-in damage defaults before parsing, so
// the numbers do not need to be here. What does is weaponmodel: cgame registers
// it when a weapon is first drawn and stops with "Couldn't find weapon model"
// if it is empty. One model for all of them is not a lie worth avoiding - the
// point is that a map loads, not that a blaster looks like a blaster.
//
// docs/Backlog.md section 10: the engine should not need a file from the retail
// game in order to use values it already has compiled in.

{
	weapontype	WP_SABER
	weaponmodel	"models/players/jkx/model.glm"
}

{
	weapontype	WP_BLASTER_PISTOL
	weaponmodel	"models/players/jkx/model.glm"
}

